  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "禹鑿龍門，通利水源。東注滄海，人民得安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2a910359916098b16da0997884ed845da598ee4331311633c03d43caeac39d64",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c63d915ccc89e2aa7ff3fb028c914c62ab58323531f0702d3a4f2730f2cfeb8a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "白鹿鳴呦，呼其老少。喜彼茂草，樂我君子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9fc69d38b2827a04ea47be42c29a6e29844b29c4cf7c0cee0b19a8eb5bbd937f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e3fcc1a9e1fea0ae02477148c3507215c7887f8eb0c989c268d145a77644c41f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "百里南行，雖微復明。去虞適秦，為穆國卿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c6950233a4d461dc2641be89ab33730f20cbab4ee85fc1bad191b07f624399a8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df32d60cd49a86bca238bed5c93acb468e5e17e92611994c450eb4e8ef5c3622"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "王孫宜家，張名益有。龍子善行，西得大壽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f1f90abb7ed6245122910c74a0a191ee1e1c7c4cf75db94c5629a3ccdafeb9da",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c83579b8cbc9b584600334803c39356c0b366b4080fdd1ae153a43d3d1f8331"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "畫龍頭頸，文章不成。甘言善語，譎辭無名。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f1d757b16e2f6570ffc2d3d38718b430ecb0bf4819df7dc82244bfa3a376739b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f4a080b5c8603af8fb0b56c8009468f2b71ab71a17b0d76bc5b9077c5b0dd2f5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "商子無良，相怨一方。引鬥交爭，咎以自當。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c0090b1f33b9436cde709b7fec161653efa8b229be2994b55ffe974c29c08957",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6889e9493cd114da9a8d90f42dca6bc6b95316aa0d80bb5fb89dff5c5413a798"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "衰老困極，無齒不食。痔病痏瘵，就陰為室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:98654abdfc4a0da63792ebb8327e9749a08f41597fab0706e5df5e5b639c28d5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7b87b4a9b0dab11d8f96d83de21e0c479c66989e2316bf49ef9f5eeec6f8fbdf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "鴛生會稽，稍巨能飛。翱翔桂林，為眾鳥雄。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:df6611d708ae81e648d3fe6bd9034a57e4ccc385b37378f54811628abc384867",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a8b485ecfe07fe214f75d6134860f85b176c4ff80742946c536a886e5c7afae4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "安平不傾，載福長生，君子以寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cce7b7fc1fea976258a3f7836df4281f8fe9bf320e286e812713809ccf99e22f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:db65a0e90b2254d2955056f18ba12428809d8acf181c6f89ebaa36993c3f8375"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "牛驥同槽，郭氏以亡。國破為墟，君奔走逃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1aa027569529bc8591319c65690a5e39d3939a97753f0763e3fd679f7464124d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:07e78ed471f0b7e2f49242da25ca108ba1f97749bc4594a23f4fcdcb5bda6368"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "日中明德，兩國盛興。仁聖會遇，君受其福。臣多榮祿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fc5d5b7491f323a094a7dbacdf9d78e8731199658c190393823a27ea1ea83bed",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5d938a406707e01f21e71de68470ab97e0b0b15487eedc20b806ad930797e4d9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "公劉之居，太王所業。可以長生，拜受福爵。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9b95639361fd692445d4969d855af3b757f9aabd220fd4045a956d2d36998f76",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3a02f644dbc60355a0b9e68c41ac6808ad608b12cc358b85ab14d0a5b4d6bcb9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "時凋歲寂，君子疾病。宋女無辜，鄭受其殃。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c58b5657a8d651c1e0a8705eeb8d093e85ea3b06d8d09a968161fc3694c775a5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:996c4bd93e6bc454f3467d0c955281da2d7abc991514e1e1669701552058989b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "濟河踰厄，脫母怵惕。四序為衛，使惠不廢。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a4a4f66f8adfc295cb966649896ccc28912cfece79528443aeb9d3dbde67b9aa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1bce46de3d709a166562c89e9cb4d86e732c7bc8f7c4d80362e642836b900d30"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "缺破不完，殘際側偏。公孫幽遏，跛倚後門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1c2d2e5bb6f6edd97c5b4615b474355af7aefaee9d87091da728c2e05510358b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f30a91c1b3bf2d727604ea35651773aa54e96889c7da03788111d61726bc8115"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "延頸遠望，昧為目病。不見叔姬，使伯心憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9805cd4d80013781f632d2309400baeb21c1ddd88d5daa7e2db3d8f9aae721cc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:17e6d3d6bf2a13b002e13bc141f646cf9474c6bb9976ac7191b3bb1c5a39e561"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "上無飛鳥，下無走獸。擾亂未清，民勞於事。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:deccc6c2d74bbe436d14f4f0a1f254b509e8e88d65b60e635f284464bffb50dc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8387586c4b33644432d769c3905f55ee72a1d07f80dcae613c8a3b507386b8d8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "久陰霖雨，塗行泥潦。民人休止，市空無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6a0cb1a8d49cf9e38eb0c9121b50e92a0a1b124fcfc0da0633124f7260fcbc4a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aff08be50c220ae45f553711f37869b8206130cec420a74cdffd965abf7e4c1c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "盲者目張，跛倚起行。瞻望日月，與主相迎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1bf9c5c8964f39d220d98c8b6d8d8fe26590ce39e1e5e7f613e7598e6b95e6b0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3ab4689dc748ed817a185116d0f398dcb777bb5433dbacdb8ea6a10343aceb12"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "据斗運樞，順天無憂。與樂並居，萬代歡慶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7347c447a93ff004063ad72c4dc68ba3fa2c2e3268625019ed4b218f7b605130",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6188d5836dbd75cb58efbcb645de27c6eb7be493722d4478d73ae587945c3886"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "稼穡不偏，重適不傾。巧言賊忠，傷我申生。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c84e742b7892c671dbaa3fd3c5834a9c174853250a4a888f54a2022deca9a72a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:602d914327df019e946b0e08b3ccb30ac14368b17d9216615d431b9054ca36de"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "金城銕郭，上下同力。政平民歡，寇不敢賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d1272eb5eec2400e2b6cfaec3d7ddd0ff182395e32a6a88f01f53e887f325b40",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ae85fc35fccca01619b195a946dc32e1fd8c4772c53dd06b1130dadd67c3b129"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "日鏡不明，冬災大傷。盜花失實，十年消亡。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bb83f2ec80d5808b602fb7088c246f6640310e0578b8b3345402d4e9fa152dfa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2c99c51fa99bee0125509850c32dba619441dab583f435564c9340741e04a006"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "鰥寡孤獨，命祿苦薄。入室無妻，武子悲哀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2e6f8d7e8b764e2d52fd5dabf9d6e9f7bda71dd48e8a98a75335fe6bbabbde23",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8b69380293332ec7af68baf432c41e9b2d34366c09923ee2c5bdf8070201d6e1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "飲酒醉飽，跳起爭鬥。伯傷叔僵，東家治喪。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:105825a7136e699876ee20752d34945ff0b0b4b640005634f7dcf00d7e35f9b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:27707cd59cc644dbe8405b06bce2ad4c0b07c5cc0994937ff83f8b5653d36aa5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "介召微子，使君不殆。二國合歡，燕齊以安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f08cfd20cb756559eb91e1b3be72ec07ea4847ab2eb5a751e28f4b625ed05918",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:61d3206b9bcc394e2a132a98ddf1de0dd7cdbacf308cfd39ca8f58d5462e53ec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "牽頸繫尾，詘折幾死。彫世無仁，不知所比。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:85fb3dcb4364061437a41d184da44a5e261517f9c1c22cc6efd2da357a24577e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b7882e8fc6d43c3cc98fa48f8efd8b08f2dfa676a190730f53b2c695b4703c65"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "東龍究毒，不知所觸。南北困窮，王子危急。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4f2691fc7818f53982c037bb28f8ba604a3c90daa5a28d4241d11ebddb220a05",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b1c5315d57e8e36aeebdb739819ae519db5c085d23583669a049117a24de62e3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "疾貧王孫，北極無輝。祿命苦薄，兩守孤門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cf4a3eef115e06fd8d316b8eb59c27612c8293a2437acdc3bb35e9047e91e5b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:22ca3baff77f4f650ad42f5d19f355d2660e1aa135cef64d472a68b697fb4d18"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "公孫駕驪，載遊東齊。延陵故產，遺季紵衣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5d0d3132cad678d489772db9ac7248fe7b15167a763e8ed702ad23a537df39a2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ab98ceec7019bbe5c9d0d7de42aca9d4f102b0d756343ba04b0d24661c5bf6d9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "王良善御，伯樂知馬。文王東獵，獲嘉賢士。開福祐周，發且興起。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0f31bd2fb0a08becb4a2db7416dec24b679b05f93720b8d4539c8ab8a6212665",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3dfc2c5fecfdaef9469194e839a6b462c334fa778c30e42945bad9d6bda13eba"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "日月不居，重耳趨舍。遊燕入秦，晉國是霸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8f6c050b4e576165ab3de50d6671f9f8a550e9841635db6c549b16fe86fbc995",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a6dde74214cae6f2d2c1dfae18ab7eb05c5b7298168003ba68494ec16d9541c4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "假文翰翼，隨風背北。至虞夏國，與舜相得。年歲大樂，邑無盜賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:24f19e1addb0868b8b13da49e8692703e4f30cd1fa7749eafad585b11ec3a7c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e69723bdc99eb03b4557523362fb1e9065d48d92f22ab12cab25da9f505a36a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "南行北走，延頸望食。舉口失利，累我子孫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cb8a2f34ebe6b38e7b4291ce8a5670f03cbb8cc44afbcbcad72e59e8ac810385",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3d7bcb9d1f3e4e984808ad09d7a41bd6a190b406fdade7bd3541115239d1f157"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "開市作喜，建造利事。平準貨寶，海內殷富。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5492a2819f7c67606f7d9bbcaed2a429d935300abfa6fe24c04d31e1e4f33e80",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b765a7f82f6beb112cc562c6c2bccab8bc98903b1a41ab5a9946a85ce6d2f360"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "三犬俱走，鬥於谷口。白者不勝，死於坂下。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:15070cd0bc4a7904782e9a873ca946705ee10f59d0dff80085b9b583c4cd5004",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bdb090e151f4d259d4affb4688d328906ac31c111ec31485077a9116135d2203"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "驕鹵火形，造惡作凶。無所能成，還自滅身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a50194d019af15d6b7196c717dce908f81bb27013f73f0cede400bf2b1b23821",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:861b227b43d5d67f37894665d5505053f60995e7aded5a0c5abd9236303eb9cc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "拜跪贊辭，無益於尤。大夫頑嚚，使我心憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8bd5f8e87e4854b52460e90697dcc4771d9dbbfd3984155cdc125838b61c7c17",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ce9cbfedda9c5d9068fe5c81a1825d5528383736f6eef1bc1dd88e983906cc2a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "辰次降婁，王嘉巡狩。廣佑施惠，萬國咸喜。子孫榮品，長安不殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d6a7ae80b556ff61a83ec367b0389f950037d15c48083e9ff58e36ac6678997e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e5d6efc522b668ae14807b24069d2a170282173be298fcc7d703b997de19dd9e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "牽瑜上樓，與福俱游。勞躬治國，安樂無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:50d394373381fb59c3ab5cfe5b8cdb79b1fc142d06c95abcdfb8ed440c252f68",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2a043e9130eab0ab523405b3a0f9a185b4563dcaf6530b3237824063a1af8642"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "白鳥御餌，鳴呼其子。旋枝張趐，來從其母。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:839ad22f19b49b498cb3bffe32fbd6d4a73593ad4fb421a685a029377f097178",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a5ecaa4efa6f0d090a06e9804ae1a1149f6e91753820ca9bf869315311968287"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "盲聾獨宿，莫與共食。老窮於人，病在心腹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1893ffe4e904ae83c7ff47ed92d343da5070ca9628f28772f7376f02e7cfd1a8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0874c4151d36a39aadd1f0abd13acabad354e3279b310c448c028d96a2442da1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "登木出淵，稍上升天。明德孔聖，白日載熒。寵祿再榮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8d6d5312eef5ca061d0802cf65bf9d77346b4bfbbeb2ecf6bfe92c582dace031",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0ecab5a81ffd21c23876a8370ad4fcbd329c8aa8a65bcd7ba88e43c0ced142c0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "彭離濟東，遷之上庸。狼戾無節，失其寵功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:948c97ccc4e7a653c9c4eb3d0054e1e6337ca2c001a8321cfd596890f90124b4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:268fa009b347668720783906826d7142709d4774c72b00767368ba9abba5d4c0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "譖陽上舞，神明正氣。禹拜受福，君使我德。居則厚祿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:93c89139d77c6cf8f59d2b82b434dc9928901e7bb84330bd97ecb056e5853edc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9d9992a78e926e5e98ebc7e2a82a66e238534868706c5f32b40ab4a699386e5d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "從首至足，部分為六。室家離散，逐南乞食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0023b2e384630c4f9d01599485b1fc30d395cbb58db521f8a66155f5cfc375d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3d48d18bb8d37e075c843c000ff555ed661f3da96445147c1543fd01756d558d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "民迷失道，亂我統紀。空使乾華，賓無所有。先憂後樂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a594ff9bee21390bec922ab1cb72001b717218248048592d9d2d8ba8221c5832",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a84198054a0373f97a643912efebe211181eaf216f318e2169a08d9c8713bfeb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "刻畫為飾，毛嬙西施，求事必得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ee13710a2bc8fed5aea070fd0c1537d2d52db7431b59b014352ad9d5b6d8e023",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b610d0243ce985222ff4b8906e0b050873a8000878023d32a0a35b800672523a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "日居月諸，遇暗不明。長夜喪甲，絕其紀綱。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f519d716f2ac4e1609ca6a0ad746e1512b879d5b85e1a3bbc7a2115d4de84bd4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:62985c2eb1b6bd138e7ae98ae63ba0c4d74d71344e9725084ec69607a2373a7f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "衣裳顛倒，為王來呼。成就東周，封受大侯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aac91ddf27e5709d402c942712c86ac94482749390477651f99bc2f366f60d29",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:48c1d0a5aa80863db5c25e47a7a5811069fc3a00326155d33a2b3cf46ad6dd17"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "當變立權，擿解患難。渙然冰釋，六國以寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7852810a4e9a05c394652dad91978ff4bee974b9938efe9838a21dbd364228f2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a2b956a88ffbebd842e20f58a0fe70ba1c92a0671707edffd46a99c532b5ad64"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "西戎獯鬻，病於我國。扶陽之政，以保乾德。終無患惑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d1f11e2bb63dbc6444c578db9751823a292ee66de21ed4ca0ad2ce1dca219b9e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2917b78cbaa3dfe6c57113620f5e42b24d105de215b421d067bc516aac814598"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "南行逐羊，子利喜亡。陰孽為病，復返其邦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0cbb49db46e455934bc9ce8bcc956143f61cdce2fe4d058c4ccbb99ef60238fe",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9c9b43ef8ad8445c27ee28c12ea9028e6309c74b81b5983a5faca4cfa0e8bf6f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "遊戲仁德，日益有福。凶言不至，妖孽滅息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2089584fbb2385e48cadced9a068cd761dae4fb81f1ed799be2556414aa3cf5c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c8cfa4c8a091147708a9b1b30a0607a39307b0405811bdc6c01c3c62c4feaf87"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "春日新婚，就陽日溫。嘉樂萬歲，獲福大椿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7bbe0d1187cab622399696743bbc1d4dc0ea4221eeb164bcb0c300ae285b5de1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39969a0c3a67163ff2e0863f7e263da62a7d405ce8348ec9302d9de3cbc1c1e8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "陰升陽伏，鬼哭其室。相飾不食，安巢如棘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:402de0506623b49dd6532b57b7fe2b2fed9936754855036279302af7695e9aa7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c0c041b752a52e6b2e72350b50d1dd2aa02f7b9ea4450d36a5c40732effdcae6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "臣尊主卑，權威日衰。侵奪無光，三家逐公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7f7ad55d75ea43fcdc6f203c6f45407052aab671b34484f3212ffc8a88848200",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:dfefb397555fbbd10ebb6b745a74f5bd9e8ef0f664341e8db58cdb03f5a7ed11"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "反言為賊，戎女生患。亂吾家國，父子相賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f8194b2c363ed058b15749ad8b640631cbfb11e5de3e302c5ba43e566404f4ec",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d888a445ef318fd91a1eb9041a6714012afa69bc1be75a5950e5ab8009e6e20d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "迎福開戶，喜逐我后。康伯愷悌，治民以禮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bfd90a6071e5872fec11c05a2b52d3dc14fd880f793b578caac89e27bd5150d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5713459def2f9177944dbfed17126d00aba2ffd80fac27a4b8dc205a03b1f571"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "日就月將，昭明有功。靈臺觀賞，膠鼓作仁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fe64040ca98ee7f46ef3d8b8e71e1c6e7725874b688083caeb2212823572ee93",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1d7dca6491b3212ad36d8bad0e9f674bc8cd49e0ba2b73a2258dc5ddd9d15e00"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "百草嘉卉，萌芽將出。昆蟲扶戶，陽明所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0846137df9fe9cd2c9d5d958fb56ef766fcdfa17b6b760fd953e0c1afad2bb00",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7b8b0ceda9cd675e993d5955f7bb61eb8ca1be14341785edbfd909f06923ec0f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "天所佑助，福至禍去，君主何憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ce73adaf119757378e887221bde336557ba72f033c8c70e16dc8c528c02b9fa1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e84630b0dca2b91b13bcfbbd5f48986a04528dae4e0f5094ac4a661e37638660"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "窮夫失居，唯守舊廬。初憂中懼，終日競競。無悔無虞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a686576ebe7d41a03350ac55efbf18900314faef700f64cc509517eae87b07fb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:784318a2654b6b77381f50d040b7093ce874e8f696293c4dc5ba59af92766a70"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 46,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "買玉得石，失其所欲。荷蕢擊磬，隱耳無聲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:39786018ef5bba7de61685d3a46c38616b03fc73d1ccec5cee0f894b4de27333",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf29b53ec37c3f7e7059c9de9193516992eef024081c191af1101be38ca0b1b2"
    }
  ]
}
